{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>He shall be free for his house for one year.</b> Here the Name is alluded to, and I have already drawn your attention to this at the end of parashat Shofetim, concerning the matter of the house, the vineyard, and the wife. And so we find concerning the Holy One, blessed be He, that at Sinai He was with Israel in the manner of a groom and bride: the Shekhinah stood on the mountain for one year, for they did not journey until the second of Iyyar in the second year."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:50:43.097050226Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}